  "details": "VRChat Version: 2021.1.2 (build 1189)\nA bug in dynamic contacts can cause the following exception as a log spam:\n```\n2022.04.21 19:27:50 Exception  -  Error: called non-existent method System.Void VRC.Utility.PhysicsUtil::ClosestPointsBetweenLineSegments(UnityEngine.Vector3,UnityEngine.Vector3,UnityEngine.Vector3,UnityEngine.Vector3,UnityEngine.Vector3&,UnityEngine.Vector3&)\n  at VRC.Utility.PhysicsUtil.ClosestPointsBetweenLineSegments (UnityEngine.Vector3 , UnityEngine.Vector3 , UnityEngine.Vector3 , UnityEngine.Vector3 , UnityEngine.Vector3& , UnityEngine.Vector3& ) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n  at VRC.Dynamics.ContactReceiver.CalcProximity (VRC.Dynamics.ContactBase collider) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n  at VRC.Dynamics.ContactReceiver.UpdateContact () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n  at VRC.Dynamics.ContactManager.LateUpdate () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n```\nFull log: https://gist.github.com/naelstrof/cf8a7edc5789377aabd2e81ffe2eb4d5\nVideo: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/410685928466808843/966903234738389023/vlc_Zla9RPV4lh.mp4\nParent constraints were involved in positioning the contact receiver.",
